From 54f650125f0d95009af2265d9252aeff595985ff Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Calogero Mandracchia <calogero@efebia.com>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 19:49:51 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] app-server: expose the channel barrier as thread/channels
 requests

thread/channels/fence closes or opens a loaded thread's channel barrier,
thread/channels/read reports it and can wait for it to drain, and
thread/channels/release drops held input the client has kept. Reads are
not serialized with the thread's other requests, so a waiting read never
delays a turn or a steer. Errors carry a reason: threadNotFound,
noChannels, fenceMismatch or fenceOpen.
